## Custom Types / Enums

### `item_role`

`Primary` | `Accessory` | `Digital` | `Packing` | `Consumable`

### `identifier_type`

`Serial_Number` | `QR_ID` | `Credentials` | `None`

### `product_tag`

`Basic` | `Combo`

### `cost_type`

`Shipping` | `Logistics`

### `listing_status`

`items-pending` | `protection-pending` | `condition-pending` | `checkout-pending` | `awaiting-delivery` | `addition-pending` | `profile-pending` | `live`

### `asset_state`

`In Store` | `Rented` | `In Transit`

### `order_status`

`new` | `preparing` | `pickup` | `active` | `completed` | `disputed` | `cancelled`

### `plan_key`

`combo` | `damage` | `theft` | `none`

